  "description": "ADO-VALUES, the 100 to 120 proposal with an external 110 witness, server keyset optimistic: L of ID 1 set to 100; recordset on that row; L put to 120; connection B sets L to 110; Value, OriginalValue, UnderlyingValue and Status are read; Update; Errors; the same reads; CancelUpdate and the reads; then a second edit to 130 with Update; and an independent reader at the end. Asks which stage reports the conflict and what each value shows.",
